<title>SPAIN: Spain settlement to be cut to 3 days from Feb 24.</title>
<headline>Spain settlement to be cut to 3 days from Feb 24.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Settlement and clearing for Spanish stocks and bonds will be reduced to three working days from five working days from February 24, the Spanish clearing house said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Servicio de Compensacion y Liquidacion de Valores SA said this is a move towards new European Union settlement guidelines.</p>
<p>Spain cut the number of settlement days to five from seven in September 1993.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
